<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.5 points to 842.8 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.5 points to 842.8 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 8.5 points on Thursday to 842.8, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the trade index losing the most, down 6.2 points, or 2.09 percent, to 289.9 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
